{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_catap_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_catap_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "掙脫",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_catap_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fc52098569b5e5ad0934bd7a714ef53335456eddc00ea6c9f31fc730d596709e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_towerinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別動，快躲起來，他們來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到裡面去，裡面。對，你別出聲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位老爺，這位老爺，別把手敲壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您巡邏辛苦了，是有什麼事啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奉巴特老爺之命，搜查嫌犯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（菲隆哥，你搞這套幹什麼？怎麼還叫老爺......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這不是得在其他人面前做做樣子嘛，拉茲老爺。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搜查嫌犯？！那可不得了，可得要好好找找！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，我這可沒有什麼嫌犯啊老爺！我們這可都是好人，您一定要明察啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（噗嗤。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（櫥櫃晃動的聲音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你屋裡還有其他人在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼會，我這哪還有什麼其他人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是老爺們聽錯了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽錯了？可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了。這麼小的房子，有沒有人一眼就能看得出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我也沒聽到什麼聲音，不要太敏感了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧......那聽你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位老爺，您看這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然這事與你無關，那就這樣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之後如果有什麼線索，記得立刻彙報給搜查隊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，一定，一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，他們終於走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎你怎麼這就出來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小聲點，人還沒走遠呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了行了，菲隆哥，別這麼緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實拉茲他剛剛應該都已經發現我了吧？剛才他能瞞著不說，現在也不可能回頭再來戳穿我啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那小子可能是想放你走，但他身後那些人可不一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敢直接炸貴族老爺私庫的人這麼多年我就見過你一個，更別說你還開著車把老頭子的金銀珠寶滿地亂撒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說空爆啊，你猜猜你現在值多少賞金？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，肯定沒我給你留的那些寶貝值的多~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，這倒沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說真的，你怎麼有膽子幹這種事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你炸的可是老頭子最寶貝的私人金庫！嚯，老頭子都氣瘋了，真要被抓到，你皮都得給扒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我總得做點什麼，才對得起大家給我取的這外號是不？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我忍死老頭也忍夠久了，現在我忍不了了......這哪是怎麼有膽子的問題，這不是被逼急了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在好了，我爽快了，大家也能撈點好處，不是皆大歡喜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說被逼急了，有的人就算被逼死了也不敢動手啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，說真的，阿萊塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，幹嘛這麼正式，突然喊我本名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和你說正經的。我還是覺得......這麼做對你壓根沒好處啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能撈著點什麼？你那些金子，那些首飾，現鈔......你什麼都沒留，全給就這麼撒在我們這群人家門口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你圖什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好處。嘿，好處......這年頭是不是幹什麼都非得要有點好處？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哎，我也不是這個意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是你看，你是老頭子養的私兵，他不缺給你們的那份錢，徵稅也收不到你們頭上，你要是想，還能自己私下再從稅金裡扣點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我啥時候還扣過你們的錢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是沒有！你要是也那麼幹，剛剛我就把你推出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正就是這麼個意思。你日子過得不差，又不像我們這群人似的，交完稅有時候連飯都吃不上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿萊塔，你到底是怎麼想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要是說我就是看死老頭不爽，其他的什麼都沒想，你信不信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那讓我想想，該給你編個什麼理由哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......喂，難得我都這麼正經了，你這傢伙就不能稍微嚴肅點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸——菲隆哥你又不是不知道，我就是這個性格嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，不開玩笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也差不多該走了，不好在你這裡多待，免得節外生枝，給菲隆哥你也惹上麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁現在走，搞不好還能混進要出鎮子的行商隊伍裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是你提前計畫好的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不想真的被暴怒的死老頭抓到扒皮嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就再見了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "替我轉告大夥，要是再有人逼得大夥活不下去，不一定還會有金庫這麼巧地炸開花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千萬別再這麼老實地等死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_county_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這貨車好窄......腿伸不直啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這到底是運了什麼，味道還不小......幸好我不暈車。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......不過運氣還不錯，前面兩個關口都很順利。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（幸好提前留意了商隊的動向，正好能搭個順風車。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這樣下去，只要能過了前面的那座橋，應該就能離開這破地方了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（等離開了這裡，下一步，就先去......去......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（去哪來著，糟糕，想不出來啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（呼啊，有點睏了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那邊............沒有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還沒有找到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（欸？怎麼都到這裡了還能碰上搜查隊的人？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
