    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我實在是忍不了了。到處都是讓人生氣的事，我覺得這生活爛透了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是這話，在鎮上那些人的面前我說不出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒餓過肚子，我哪有資格對著吃不上飯的人嫌棄自己過得不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你還是因為那些交不上稅的平民......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，別說得我好像什麼正義使者一樣。我沒那麼濫好心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒指望自己能替其他人做點什麼。炸那個死老頭的金庫也好，把裡頭的東西全撒了也好，全都只是替我自己出口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這麼簡單~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "意外地是個想得很清楚的小孩哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，還是有一些不太謹慎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉茲——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在這幹什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆&巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好，他們往這邊過來了，你快躲起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得容易......這裡沒地方能躲啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉茲？你在幹什麼......你是在和什麼人說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（糟了，來不及了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，是我稍微佔用了這位先生一點時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（——誰？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（從背後走出來的......這個女人難道剛剛一直就在我身後？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......等等，不，您、您是？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打擾各位了。請不要這樣緊張，我只是路過這裡的旅人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛是我在向這位先生問路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......這樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......啊，沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......請問，您是......難道您是那位燭騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，那確實是我的封號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燭騎士？！就是那個有名的萊塔尼亞人騎士......我還看過好幾場比賽呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然能在這裡見到您這樣的名人！這......這，騎士小姐，能、能請您給我簽個名嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您的誇讚。如果我的簽名就可以的話，非常樂意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這女人完全把其他人的注意都引走了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（到底......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（噓。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（她這是在朝我眨眼......？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡似乎不是交談的好地方，不介意的話，我們邊走邊說吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好我想要拜訪這裡的領主閣下......可以勞煩諸位帶路嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "搜查隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然......當然！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（真的把人都引走了......我這是，被救了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（空爆。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（什麼？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（其實我過來找你，不是為了什麼別的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我只是想親口對你說一句......我沒有像你這樣的勇氣，但我佩服你。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這個小鎮太小了，這裡對你來說或許是種拘束。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_217",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（趁現在，你快走吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻煩了。本來還想著把該算的帳都算清了，能瀟瀟灑灑地開始新生活的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仔細想想，這一路不是又欠了新的人情嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算啦~在老家留幾個回想起來還不錯的兄弟，這種感覺也不差~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有那位燭騎士小姐，真是個怪人......不過確實幫了大忙，下次再有比賽，就押你全勝當作報答好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這回可真的是再會了，各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再會了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，現在該好好想想，接下來該去哪才好呢~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "char_282_catap",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之先離開卡西米爾，到外面看看吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
